	(text "Copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheet 24 (RTL8125BG, external 0.95 V core supply).\nLeft out on purpose: the zero-ohm option links, the unpopulated strap resistors, and the\ncommon-mode/ESD filters on the MDI pairs (the reference part could not be matched to an LCSC part).\nJack: HanRun HR911130C, pinout taken from its datasheet (vendor/lcsc_C50933/datasheet.pdf), which\nmatches the LCSC symbol and not the Radxa drawing. It is rated 100/1000Base-T only: validate it at\n2.5 Gb or substitute a 2.5G-rated jack. Centre tap P1 has a capacitor to ground only, as in the reference.\nReference clock comes from the PCIe clock buffer (sheet not drawn yet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
